{0 Validated query and workspace JSON}

{!Libtmux_json} is an optional Yojson boundary. Decoders reject duplicate and
unknown properties, wrong operand types, invalid UTF-8 and bounded-document
violations before constructing typed OCaml values.

{!Libtmux_json.Expr} implements the declared scalar pane subset of
[libtmux.filter/1]. Java regex and relationship documents are unsupported.

{!Libtmux_json.Workspace} decodes [libtmux.workspace/1] without I/O. Explicit
argv and shell code remain distinct. Relative directories resolve against the
file directory; decoding never reads the process environment or evaluates
shell expansion.
